OL,3,GNEWSAWatchdog calls for clarity on use
OL,4,Aof #755m ScotWind cash
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Scottish government must be much
OL,7,Fmore transparent about how it plans to
OL,8,Fuse the #755m generated by the leasing
OL,9,Fof offshore wind farm options,
OL,10,FScotland's public spending watchdog has
OL,11,Fsaid.
OL,13,FThe Auditor General for Scotland's
OL,14,Freport said ministers had drawn down
OL,15,F#96m of the ScotWind funds so far and
OL,16,Fexpected to spend a further #507m by
OL,17,F2031, but it has not been clear about
OL,18,Fhow it will use the cash.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,427,420,260,160,0,100
