OL,3,GNEWSAWatchdog calls for clarity on use
OL,4,Aof #755m ScotWind cash
OL,5,
OL,6,FOpposition parties said the government
OL,7,Fhad pledged to set up a "ScotWind
OL,8,Fwealth fund", but was instead using the
OL,9,Fmoney to plug gaps in Scotland's
OL,10,Ffinances.
OL,12,FThe Scottish government said it
OL,13,Frecognised the importance of providing
OL,14,Fclarity and would do so during the
OL,15,Fannual budget-setting process.
